# This package repackages the prebuilt Arch package published by
# https://github.com/ffyfox/dsh-desktop-linux/releases (Electron app plus a
# bundled CPython/pnpm runtime under /opt). Namcap only reasons about system
# packages, so its payload rules misfire structurally on upstream artifacts
# that cannot be rebuilt here without rewriting upstream's output:
#
#   pydepends        infers Arch python-* dependencies from the bundled
#                    site-packages, which resolve inside the payload at runtime
#   shebangdepends   reads the payload's python/node/sh shebangs as Arch deps
#   sodepends        same, for ELF NEEDED entries satisfied by payload libraries
#   unusedsodepends  ldd -u against the build host, not the shipping runtime
#   rpath / runpath  upstream build-host RPATH (/tools/deps/lib) and the
#                    CI-runner RUNPATH baked into sherpa-onnx.node
#   elfpaths         namcap only accepts ELF under /usr, /bin, /sbin, /lib;
#                    upstream and its users expect everything under /opt
#   elfgnurelro      hardening flags of upstream binaries; repacking cannot
#                    relink them
#   fhs-manpages     the bundled CPython ships its own share/man tree
#
# Everything else (licenses, symlinks, permissions, pacman metadata, file
# ownership, hooks, missing vars) still runs and can fail the build.
pydepends
shebangdepends
sodepends
unusedsodepends
rpath
runpath
elfpaths
elfgnurelro
fhs-manpages
